OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for life over failed
OL,4,Aknife attack at Israeli embassy in
OL,5,ALondon
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man who tried to break into the
OL,8,FIsraeli embassy in London to carry out
OL,9,Fa knife attack has been jailed for life
OL,10,Fwith a minimum term of 20 years.
OL,12,FAbdullah Albadri was carrying two
OL,13,Fknives when he attempted to get inside
OL,14,Fthe embassy in Kensington on 28 April
OL,15,F2025, before being detained by armed
OL,16,Fpolice.
OL,18,FThe 34-year-old from Kuwait had arrived
OL,19,Fin the UK on a small boat 16 days
OL,20,Fearlier.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
